  "content": "\n\n<p>这是 Immersive Vehicles 的<strong>官方内容包</strong>。</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">要使此包正常工作，必须安装核心模组“<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Vehicles</a>”！<span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 链接</a>）<br></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\">OCP 也在 Modrinth 上提供！<br>（以防 Forge 服务中断）<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-vehicles-official-content-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CND1WIc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a></span><a href=\"http://patreon.com/IV_official_content_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fVhkEbh.png\" alt=\"赞助支持\" width=\"348\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmtsiv_officialcontentpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SeJGwJ9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"236\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eafDLSV.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"795\" height=\"362\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CxBu34m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"52\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-iv-official-automobile-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wi3yEwu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"257\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-automotives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dWes3um.png\" width=\"856\" height=\"107\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sign-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa043365df31607f6b7ac7c24df8e3efe06630a7_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"256\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">OCP 包含先进的飞机、汽车、坦克、直升机和卡车，其功能设计力求简洁。<br>这不仅是为了从技术层面展示 Immersive Vehicles 模组的潜力，<br>也是为了提供精心打造的沉浸式且易用的飞行与驾驶体验。<br>所有载具及零件均可在生存模式中制作。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请在下方详细查看各款载具！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/apRUgYe.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RxK3sCS.png\" alt=\"Skyhawk &amp; Bell206\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MfGIpIt.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ybvv7Xa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aE3MVrL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HY7wchP.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nb5LNxq.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aNKRbE4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5HEH2rk.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/blFi6rM.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F6iFmRL.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3d3yeOk.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jeTK6PU.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>以及装饰物</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/otpbypM.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AKAXBfj.png\" alt=\"核心模组\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/DonBruce64/MTSOfficialPack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uhkx7YA.png\" alt=\"OCP GitHub\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/dzdqWWG2dE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mzfdgBd.png\" alt=\"MTS Discord\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Immersive Vehicles&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; OCP GitHub&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MTS Discord</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/DonBruce64/MinecraftTransportSimulator/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o5QuwAr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"106\"></strong></a></p>",
